OL,3,GNEWSATown to make new attempt to break
OL,4,Aelf world record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dorset seaside town will once again
OL,7,Fattempt to break a world record by
OL,8,Ffilling the streets with as many
OL,9,FChristmas elves as possible.
OL,11,FWeymouth has been trying to beat a
OL,12,Frecord set in Thailand in 2014 for the
OL,13,Flargest gathering of people dressed as
OL,14,Felves.
OL,16,FDespite everyone's efforts, the Dorset
OL,17,Fseaside town did not claim the record
OL,18,Flast year, but there are hopes it can
OL,19,Fthis festive season.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
