OL,3,GNEWSATown to make new attempt to break
OL,4,Aelf world record
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the 2025 attempt, Business
OL,7,FImprovement District (BID) leader Dawn
OL,8,FRondeau-Irvine said: "The record was
OL,9,F1,762 people and we got the numbers but
OL,10,Fjust in the wrong order."
